{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3b7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a14390-a8e3-7500-ab07-f35718b900bc"},"sequence":54,"recorded_at":1780531400000103,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a14390-aea6-7e42-a3f6-3236dfbb4802","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"01a14390-aea6-7e42-a3f6-3236dfbb4802","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a14390-aea6-7e42-a3f6-3236dfbb4802"},"call_id":"call_01a14390e777700cb42bd4c9e322bdbf","text":"Read text file `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/muse-wonder-approval-20261015/code-review-package.md`.\n1|# Code Review Package — muse-wonder-approval-20261015\n2|\n3|## 1. Metadata & Artifact Hashes\n4|- **Task ID**: `muse-wonder-approval-20261015`\n5|- **Criticality**: `S2` (`entry=full`, `parent_skill=analyst-teamlead`, downstream panel)\n6|- **Architecture Spec**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/muse-wonder-approval-20261015/architecture/arch-spec.md` (`sha256=1b66622035d122d2cf18c80df0ff54c3285830158478580ddd9942218429b8af`)\n7|- **Architecture Packet**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/muse-wonder-approval-20261015/architecture/architecture-packet.json` (`sha256=9ddc18254368aa868db6bdff1df2fcb91426f87bc6c4fe90fd7be90f73b830c6`)\n8|- **ARCH_PANEL Proof (Round r93)**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/muse-wonder-approval-20261015/panel/arch/r93/panel-proof.json` (`sha256=2b1dd4eda1dc88035de7eefbd26da43d9a3d1277491cdc93b409865a28294bb3`)\n9|- **Coder Plan**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/muse-wonder-approval-20261015/plans/coder-01.json` (`sha256=7fe8e9b1ce146f4a113470cbefab645bb7a903ad7e172d4f480fd176a662d484`)\n10|- **Coder Artifact**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/muse-wonder-approval-20261015/coder.json` (`sha256=03481d34d34d32d50780a283b5fbbacf49bedc51d7838d38f137b12bdb943963`)\n11|- **Verifier Receipt**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/muse-wonder-approval-20261015/receipts/verifier-receipt.json` (`sha256=3dd50b49cc4e840ed6c120b6987830524123af8563efbfa91011c2a9b9713955`)\n12|- **Modified Production File**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/bridges/muse-bridge/server.py` (`sha256=ce9fd9c8129924650f2d9f756ffd14a00c612871bc3bd7074d49e755c687f3cc`)\n13|- **Modified Test File**: `/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_muse_bridge_killpg.py` (`sha256=5ca7da36922d396797ce96f68a54c9fa9f23557bbaec4f2b401b99214c50c3c7`)\n14|- **Git Commits**:\n15|  - Baseline REQ-MUSE-001: `9f87eb083545c0b6fdc5de0827ae50ae9b7c40b9` (`[agent] fix(muse-bridge): прунинг контекста Wonder 400k/320k/200k (REQ-MUSE-001, принятый базис)`)\n16|  - Implementation REQ-MUSE-002/003/004: `4548dd30840e42fbba218f36cb0bb23ff81b660e` (`[agent] fix(muse-bridge): approval без рестарта хода, ретрай net-timeout, live reasoning (REQ-MUSE-002/003/004)`)\n17|\n18|## 2. Requirements & Architecture Decisions Traceability Matrix\n19|| Requirement / AD | Exact Implementation in `bridges/muse-bridge/server.py` | Unit Tests in `tests/test_muse_bridge_killpg.py` | Status |\n20||---|---|---|---|\n21|| `REQ-MUSE-002` / `AD-001`: approvalMode `allowAll` on `session/start` (env `denyUnmatched` support via `AD-007`); structured audit logging of auto-approved choices | `ApprovalPolicy`, `ServeRun.execute`, `_log_approval_decision` | `ApprovalTest` (22 tests, including `test_t_a01`, `test_t_a14`, `test_t_a10`) | PASS |\n22|| `REQ-MUSE-002` / `AD-002`: Handle in-turn `approval/request` without `ServeUnavailable`/exec restart: return receipt `result={}`, then `approval/decide` with `choiceId` from `availableChoices`; `userInput/request` -> `userInput/cancel`; latch terminal denials; 15s cancel grace | `ApprovalPolicy.decide`, `ServeRun._handle_approval_request`, `ServeRun._handle_user_input_request`, terminal latch | `ApprovalTest`: `test_t_a02_approval_in_turn_decides_without_exec`, `test_t_a08_error_codes_latch`, `test_t_a09b_cancel_grace`, `test_t_a13_terminal_latch` | PASS |\n23|| `REQ-MUSE-002` / `AD-006`: Server `-32030` ceiling: log warning, fallback to single exec pre-turn, no second `session/start` or decide | `ServeRun._handle_session_start_error` | `ApprovalTest.test_t_a11_ceiling_fallback` | PASS |\n24|| `REQ-MUSE-003` / `AD-003`: Transient net-timeout retry loop in `Handler`: pre-action boundary (before first byte of `turn/start`), max 2 retries, 2s/4s backoff + jitter; absolute deadline `D = t0 + min(TIMEOUT_S, 1800)`, `E = D - 35`, `W = D - 12`; single slot retained | `Handler._can_start`, `Handler.handle_request` retry loop, monotonic deadlines | `TransientRetryTest` (14 tests, including `test_t_r01`, `test_t_r06`, `test_t_r07`, `test_t_r08`, `test_t_r10`, `test_t_r11`, `test_t_r12`) | PASS |\n25|| `REQ-MUSE-004` / `AD-004`: Live reasoning SSE sink: prefix-monotonic streaming of `summary.0` reasoning deltas, freeze on first delta index > 0 or `item/completed`, final reconciliation with full text `F`; single bounded `_sse_write` (timeout 3s) for all writers | `_live_reasoning_sink`, `_sse_write`, `_send_sse` | `LiveReasoningTest` (12 tests, including `test_t_l01`, `test_t_l06`, `test_t_l07`, `test_t_l08a_b_c`, `test_t_l09`) | PASS |\n26|| `AD-005` (REQ-MUSE-001): Context pruning 400k/320k/200k, atomic tool pairs, single context retry | Inherited baseline in `server.py` | `ContextPruneTest`, `ContextRetryTest` (21 tests) | PASS |\n27|| `F-001` (a4): Setup-approval latches `ACTION_POSSIBLE` before receipt | `ApprovalPolicy.on_approval_seen`, `ACTION_POSSIBLE` flag | `test_t_a16_setup_approval_barrier`, `test_t_r11_setup_retry_barrier` | PASS |\n28|| `F-002` (a4): Absolute deadline `W` for all writers, frame limit `L = min(s+3, W)` | `_sse_write`, monotonic deadline check | `test_t_l08`, `test_t_l09`, `test_t_r12` | PASS |\n29|| `F-004` (a4): Validate startup constants | `validate_startup_constants